      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOCTURNAL (4) ended his last campaign with back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance and returned in the same form, drawing wider than this but working to the front before posting an easy win in a Breeders Challenge heat at Newcastle. Proven second-up so should be improved and draws to go forward again. NEPTUNITE (8) continued his good form when he chased Inter Dominion placegetter Nyack for second at Wagga last start. Cops a wide draw but he is a smart three-year-old with a good strike rate. ENJABONARLO (7) is another last-start winner of a Breeders Challenge heat, leading and digging deep to score at Bathurst. Draws wider but he is a two-time winner at this circuit and distance. The mares SNAP SHOT NZ (2) and DAVOLAS LEGACY NZ (1) are both good enough to be competitive from low draws.",
